roine of story. Is very mysterious and tends to keep to herself. According to Tooyama said to have most perfect butt."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22831"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と同じクラスで無言の女神。パーフェクトな尻を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績優秀。試験では常に学年２位をキープ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"運動神経もよく、健康な体を持ち、入学当初から無遅刻無欠席。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして、誰もがうらやむ美しい容姿をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は無言だが、一度口を開くと見た目からは想像できない"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"毒を含んだブラックなトークが始まる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"独特なユーモアセンスをもつ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は、主人公や数人としか、話さない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3279","sourceWorkId":"16140","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績優秀で運動神経も良く、 パーフェクトな尻を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして、誰もがうらやむ美しい容姿をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は無言だが、一度口を開くと見た目からは想像できない毒を含んだブラックなトークが始まる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"独特なユーモアセンスをもつ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"完治とは恋人同士。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3279","sourceWorkId":"20191","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と同じクラスで、無言の女神。パーフェクトな尻を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績優秀で、試験では常に学年2位をキープ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"運動神経も良く、健康な身体を持ち、入学当初から無遅刻無欠席。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして、誰もが羨む美しい容姿をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は無言だが、一度口を開くと見た目からは想像できない毒を含んだブラックなトークが始まる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"独特なユーモアセンスをもつが、普段は主人公など数人としか話さない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「行動に正しいも間違いもないわ。結果がいいか悪いかだけよ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46291"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/03/0301450bbbb2b6b68f8b67464174823c18f61cd911ac184dcab9abfb40bec23b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/84/841caece804a118ff823070431aed422e52b2a6e9eb89c99c65cf6422d4d8eeb.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"春日アン","creatorId":"vndb:s638","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s638","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s638","name":"春日アン(春乃うらら)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:24728:46291:6480:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c26592","characterName":"綾芽 桜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"46292","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"24728"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9522"],"vndbCharacterId":"c26592"},"originalCharacterName":"綾芽 桜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sakura is classmate and friend of Tooyama. She is classic Deredere that secretly likes Tooyama. Is very kind and could be consider a polar opposite of Shizuku."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c26592"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と同じクラス。胸は小さいが見事な尻を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"健気で元気な女の子で学園の花壇の花を一人で面倒を見るなど、優しさに溢れた子でもあり、いじめ等の間違ったことが許せない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが、そのせいでクラスで浮いてしまうこともある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とある出来事から主人公に助けられた時から、主人公にべた惚れで、何をしても主人公を褒めるようになってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来は元気な子だが、責められると弱い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9522","sourceWorkId":"16140","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と同じクラス。 胸は小さいが見事な尻を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"健気で元気な女の子。 学園の花壇を一人で面倒見るなど、優しさにあふれた子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いじめなど間違ったことは許せないが、そのせいでクラスで浮いてしまうことも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とある出来事で主人公に助けられ、その時からベタ惚れ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が何をしても褒め称えるようになってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「うん、遠山君には感謝してる。いつも……感謝してる」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46292"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e6/e63bc5c35a7f886ba467312f1076c4b1e6774b731ff9ab36cfd1538a4b88da62.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f6/f646978edc79b6d02a1f67dc0234683de3fd0b92b12ade347d0e8e673186fe01.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"平松真奈実","creatorId":"vndb:s857","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s857","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s857","name":"平松 真奈実","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:24728:46292:19253:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c26593","characterName":"早乙女 健也","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"46294","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"24728"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9523"],"vndbCharacterId":"c26593"},"originalCharacterName":"早乙女 健也","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Classmate and friend of Tooyama. Willing or unwilling is usually person Tooyama talks to when it comes to talking about butts. A rational and pragmatic person, unlike Tooyama tends to think about situation and people before acting or talking."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c26593"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と同じクラスで女子に人気のある、芝居がかった話し方をする嫌味なイケメン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本名は“早乙女伽夜”という少女で男のふりをして学園に入学している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女歌舞伎の家に生まれ、役作りの為に男子として育てられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は芝居がかったキザな男を演じている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公に女であることがばれるが、黙っていてくれていることに感じ入り主人公に惚れる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公にしか、デレは見せない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9523","sourceWorkId":"16140","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と同じクラスで女子に人気のある、芝居がかった話し方をする嫌味なイケメン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本名は早乙女伽夜 （さおとめ かや） という少女で、男のふりをして学園に入学している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女歌舞伎の家に生まれ、役作りのために男子として育てられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公に女であることがバレるが、黙ってくれていることに感じ入り惚れる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公にしか デレは見せない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「君は僕が、ただキザな台詞を吐くだけの男だと思っていたのか？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46294"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/98791a3317a3069905ec62cb26289dd4edd37ad2af910e343437b218342de64c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7a/7ae4dcacc97474acc1b0e34104dd55db2e0a88c4c26d7c05b913e1afaa2510c3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"前田恵","creatorId":"vndb:s11","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11","name":"前田 恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:24728:46294:8580:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c47291","characterName":"遠山 完治","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c47291"},"originalCharacterName":"遠山 完治","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p1954","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:2690","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1954","name":"Apricot Cherry","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:16140:2690","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p1954","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p1954","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1954","name":"Apricot Cherry","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:19277:v8089","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p1954","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p1954","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1954","name":"Apricot Cherry","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:21945:v8089","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p1954","